This function should return the total size of all files, but it always returns 0. Why, and how do I fix it?

```js
async function totalSize(paths) {
  let total = 0;
  paths.forEach(async (p) => {
    const st = await fs.promises.stat(p);
    total += st.size;
  });
  return total;
}
```

